{"seq":4,"slug":"carbon-market","title":"碳市场与碳定价","stage":"DONE","category":"climate-energy-transition","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/climate-energy-transition/carbon-market","rating":{"composite":3.83,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.2,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 碳市场与碳定价\n\n碳市场是通过市场化机制为温室气体排放赋予经济成本，从而引导全社会以最低成本实现减排目标的制度安排。其核心逻辑是将\"排放权\"转化为可交易的资产，让碳排放从\"免费的外部性\"变为\"有价格的生产要素\"，通过价格信号驱动企业的投资决策和技术选择向低碳方向转型。\n\n## 核心机制\n\n碳定价工具主要包括三类：**碳排放权交易体系（ETS）** 通过设定排放总量上限并允许配额交易实现\"量控价随\"；**碳税** 直接对排放量征收固定税率，提供明确的价格信号；**混合机制** 则结合两者优势，在价格确定性与减排确定性之间寻求平衡。截至 2025 年，全球已运行 80 项碳定价机制（43 项碳税 + 37 项 ETS），覆盖全球约 28% 的温室气体排放，年收入突破 1000 亿美元。\n\n## 发展历程\n\n碳市场的演进经历了三个阶段：**探索期（1997—2012）** 以《京都议定书》下的清洁发展机制（CDM）为代表，建立了国际碳信用交易的基本框架；**成熟期（2013—2020）** 欧盟 ETS 进入第三阶段，从免费分配转向拍卖为主，碳价发现功能逐步完善；**扩张期（2021 至今）** 中国全国碳市场启动、《巴黎协定》第六条机制落地、CBAM 正式实施，标志着碳定价从区域实践走向全球治理工具。\n\n## 章节导读\n\n本知识库从四个维度系统梳理碳市场体系：\n\n- **碳定价机制**：解析 ETS、碳税、混合机制的设计原理与优劣比较\n- **中国碳市场**：聚焦全国碳排放权交易市场架构、MRV 体系及 CCER 自愿碳市场\n- **全球碳市场**：覆盖 EU ETS 演进、《巴黎协定》第六条及碳边境调节机制\n- **碳金融创新**：前瞻碳衍生品、碳信用方法学与数字化碳基础设施\n\n碳市场正处于从\"覆盖面扩张\"向\"机制深化\"转型的关键节点——2026 年中国碳市场扩围至水泥、钢铁、电解铝，覆盖排放量超 60 亿吨；欧盟 CBAM 正式征收、ETS2 即将启动；Article 6.4 机制发行首批碳信用。理解碳市场的底层逻辑与前沿演进，是把握全球气候治理与产业转型方向的基础。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"carbon-pricing-mechanisms","title":"碳定价机制","docCount":3,"url":"/h/climate-energy-transition/carbon-market/carbon-pricing-mechanisms","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"emissions-trading-systems","title":"碳排放权交易体系的设计与运行","url":"/h/climate-energy-transition/carbon-market/carbon-pricing-mechanisms/emissions-trading-systems"},{"seq":2,"slug":"carbon-tax-design","title":"碳税设计与实施","url":"/h/climate-energy-transition/carbon-market/carbon-pricing-mechanisms/carbon-tax-design"},{"seq":3,"slug":"hybrid-pricing-approaches","title":"混合定价机制","url":"/h/climate-energy-transition/carbon-market/carbon-pricing-mechanisms/hybrid-pricing-approaches"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"china-carbon-market","title":"中国碳市场","docCount":3,"url":"/h/climate-energy-transition/carbon-market/china-carbon-market","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"national-ets-structure","title":"全国碳排放权交易市场架构","url":"/h/climate-energy-transition/carbon-market/china-carbon-market/national-ets-structure"},{"seq":2,"slug":"mrv-compliance","title":"MRV与履约机制","url":"/h/climate-energy-transition/carbon-market/china-carbon-market/mrv-compliance"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ccer-voluntary-market","title":"CCER与自愿碳市场","url":"/h/climate-energy-transition/carbon-market/china-carbon-market/ccer-voluntary-market"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"global-carbon-markets","title":"全球碳市场","docCount":3,"url":"/h/climate-energy-transition/carbon-market/global-carbon-markets","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"eu-ets-evolution","title":"EU ETS演进：全球碳市场标杆","url":"/h/climate-energy-transition/carbon-market/global-carbon-markets/eu-ets-evolution"},{"seq":2,"slug":"article6-mechanisms","title":"《巴黎协定》第六条机制","url":"/h/climate-energy-transition/carbon-market/global-carbon-markets/article6-mechanisms"},{"seq":3,"slug":"carbon-border-adjustment","title":"碳边境调节机制（CBAM）","url":"/h/climate-energy-transition/carbon-market/global-carbon-markets/carbon-border-adjustment"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"carbon-finance-innovation","title":"碳金融创新","docCount":3,"url":"/h/climate-energy-transition/carbon-market/carbon-finance-innovation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"carbon-derivatives","title":"碳衍生品市场","url":"/h/climate-energy-transition/carbon-market/carbon-finance-innovation/carbon-derivatives"},{"seq":2,"slug":"carbon-credits-methodology","title":"碳信用方法学","url":"/h/climate-energy-transition/carbon-market/carbon-finance-innovation/carbon-credits-methodology"},{"seq":3,"slug":"digital-carbon-infrastructure","title":"数字化碳基础设施","url":"/h/climate-energy-transition/carbon-market/carbon-finance-innovation/digital-carbon-infrastructure"}]}]}